          "text": "def NOD(a, b):\n    big_divisors = 1\n    for j in range(1, min(a, b)+1):\n        if a % j == 0 and b % j == 0:\n            big_divisors = j\n    return big_divisors\n\nM = [int(i) for i in open('17.txt')]\ncount = 0\nmaxi = 0\nfor i in range(0, len(M)-1):\n    if M[i] % 2 == 0 and M[i+1] % 2 == 0:\n        if NOD(M[i], M[i+1]) > 100:\n            count += 1\n            maxi = max(maxi, abs(M[i] - M[i+1]))\nprint(count, maxi)"
